# Supabase client config for the vault-app project (user data + Google sign-in).
# Both values are public client credentials — the publishable key is safe to
# expose; row-level security is the actual boundary. Copy this file to .env for
# local dev, and set the same two vars in Vercel project settings for deploys.
# Leave them unset to run the app local-only (no sign-in, no sync).
